  "title": "FMC Corporation Announces Election of Michael F. Barry to Board of Directors",
  "summary": "FMC Corporation (NYSE: FMC), a leading global agricultural sciences company, today announced the election of Michael F. Barry to the company’s Board of Directors, effective February 27, 2026. He will serve on the Audit and Compensation and Human Capital committees.",
